message: "If you use these results, please cite this repository, the DilutionAttention technical report and Kimi Linear."
title: "Dilution-KDA: Kimi Linear's hybrid layout with dilution attention at 209M parameters and 16K context"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Royer-Research-Labs/Dilution-KDA"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24269647
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24269647
